---
/* Deliberately loud. These pages cannot legally go live with gaps, so a
   missing field should be impossible to miss rather than a quiet blank.
   Delete each block as the detail is filled in. */
---
<p
  class="not-prose my-4 border-l-4 border-error bg-error/10 px-5 py-4 font-body text-sm text-error"
  role="note"
>
  <strong>PENDIENTE:</strong> <slot />
</p>
